From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cool-retro-term-wezterm <build@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:38:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Live CRT preview for the settings sliders

A configuration reload takes a few hundred milliseconds (every assignment
to a config_builder builds and converts a whole Config), too slow for a
slider.  window:set_crt_preview{...} shows CRT values at once: the window
draws with its configuration's CRT settings plus those values until the
next configuration reload, which drops them.  All readers of the CRT
settings in the window go through TermWindow::crt_config().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
